    "norm": "Tests complex escaping where {@code $$} is the escape sequence that prevents the following {@code ${...}} from being substituted, emitting a literal {@code ${...}} in the output instead. <p>Escaping rules used here: <ul> <li>{@code $${X}} → literal {@code ${X}} (the {@code $$} escapes the delimiter)</li> <li>{@code ${animal}} → {@code \"quick brown fox\"}</li> <li>{@code ${target}} → {@code \"lazy dog\"}</li> <li>{@code ${undefined.number:-1234567890}} → default value {@code \"1234567890\"}</li> </ul>"
